discovery of nearly 1,000 Roman silver coins, one of the most significant archaeological finds in Germany in recent years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Military aircraft crashes near US air base in Spangdahlem, Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:61685a1bf4067901b43835db270f6ba107375d9e300d6fe744ba1994e4aa2d93</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:48:28Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/military-aircraft-crashes-near-us-air-base-in-spangdahlem-germany/a-79376025--82e638c408d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/military-aircraft-crashes-near-us-air-base-in-spangdahlem-germany/a-79376025?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The F-16 pilot was able to safely eject from the plane and was taken to receive medical care. The incident occurred near Spangdahlem Air Base in the German state of Rhineland-Palatinate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US-China AI race: Does Trump want to regulate AI by forming a new task force and a special envoy for artificial intelligence in the US?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:33d25ddce2eb13887fce722e38901bd0700a1eb31060649956d1ce31f785ab3b</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:48:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-china-ai-race-does-trump-want-to-regulate-ai-by-forming-a-new-task-force-and-a-special-envoy-for-/a-79372591--6f057766415d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-china-ai-race-does-trump-want-to-regulate-ai-by-forming-a-new-task-force-and-a-special-envoy-for-artificial-intelligence-in-the-us/a-79372591?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Do Trump's task force and a special envoy for artificial intelligence in the US indicate a move toward regulating this disputed technology, particularly vis-a-vis China?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><