ide school</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:232b643e31f4d82cee62ec8beeb32b0d5f45ec71f58efc2401d3d2d7a543f783</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/turkey-several-pupils-injured-in-shooting-outside-school/a-79368728--cc52dff21bd4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-several-pupils-injured-in-shooting-outside-school/a-79368728?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The shooter, a pupil, allegedly took a rifle and shot indiscriminately at his schoolmates in front of their high school. Turkey was shocked by two back-to-back school shootings earlier this year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia, Ukraine trade deadly strikes as Zelenskyy attends UNGA</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3baaeb17eca1bd028b9674624ac44e0965108aae4d34154127896885605f11e4</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-trade-deadly-strikes-as-zelenskyy-attends-unga/a-79366022--933d7c07ec6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-trade-deadly-strikes-as-zelenskyy-attends-unga/a-79366022?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Russian army targeted economic infrastructure in Ukraine, while Ukraine struck an oil refinery. This comes ahead of the UN General Assembly, where President Volodymyr Zelenskyy is due to meet Trump on the sidelines.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Male infertility is 'grossly underreported'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d56cbd4f26d7467b8389c3199ff23c9c692baeb3c60c0e7b14b7a7274ebe19d1</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722--14a06576edd4.html" type="text/ht