y><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Will Germany have enough gas this winter amid energy supply crunch?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fda04f10c823f73fb5f61cc629975e68048f4163a7f0f2a933e47724410a0217</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T08:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-germany-have-enough-gas-this-winter-amid-energy-supply-crunch/a-79360317--cfd94c55c93d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-germany-have-enough-gas-this-winter-amid-energy-supply-crunch/a-79360317?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's gas storage sites are far less full than in recent years. Officials say supplies are secure, but analysts warn that a cold winter or import disruptions could push prices higher. So how secure is the supply?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: VW to step up cost-cutting program</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:059d8aa1b103dd0fd2da1d31fa8221c1f7db48b22fffb00185bbf90bbd8682c7</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T07:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-vw-to-step-up-cost-cutting-program/live-79365190--a755a3e03dbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-vw-to-step-up-cost-cutting-program/live-79365190?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Volkswagen's chief says the carmaker will accelerate its streamlining measures as workers protest. The Israeli ambassador says the Left Party win in Berlin polls poses a risk to the city's Jewish community. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How will Germany's Merz respond after crushing state election results and losses to the far right?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c54c85314065f1fd0042bbe3a8b5bac4e1da0ba2a5d768aee2daf4d0344c8661</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:48:43Z</updated><published>2026-0