ce-investigate-alleged-gang-rape-in-delhi/live-79365177?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While India is fuming over a viral video of two minors being harassed in Bihar, a case of an alleged gang-rape of a minor has emerged in a posh Delhi neighborhood. Meanwhile, India's foreign minister is at the UNGA.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>G7 demands Houthis 'immediately' cease Saudi strikes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf7ded6e25b1e3b2d79d621a0da05471626179492824f796f0399ca1544992a5</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T04:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/g7-demands-houthis-immediately-cease-saudi-strikes/a-79364964--b1476907806f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/g7-demands-houthis-immediately-cease-saudi-strikes/a-79364964?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The G7 nations have accused Yemen's Houthi rebels of targeting civilian shipping near Saudi Arabia. UK PM Andy Burnham said he will offer "time-limited" and "defensive" military support to repel the attacks.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK: Man charged over suspected role in Rwanda genocide</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:50d5966818664a2fd7bb2d83b9617b3653aaf9387f817a369120ef7e2333f65e</id><updated>2026-09-22T19:47:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T21:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-man-charged-over-suspected-role-in-rwanda-genocide/a-79364493--8067a57ec627.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-man-charged-over-suspected-role-in-rwanda-genocide/a-79364493?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The suspect has been accused of directing and inciting acts of murder and genocide carried out by others in Rwanda.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
